<title>USA: U.S. stocks open slightly higher, bonds firm.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open slightly higher, bonds firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened lightly higher at the opening of trading on Monday with few fresh factors to give the market much direction. Firm bonds help lend slightly positive tone to stocks.</p>
<p>Dow industrials were up 5 to 6353.</p>
</text>
